  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut haloumi into 1cm slices (you should get 3 pieces per person). In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.\n• Cut zucchini and carrot into bite-size chunks. Slice brown onion into thick wedges.\n• Place veggies on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with Persian spice blend, season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-657aa977a65f6d71569fc17e-23ab7a66.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. Cook haloumi in batches for the best results.\n• Remove pan from heat, add honey and a splash of water and turn haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-657aa977a65f6d71569fc17e-7bcb2e3c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine the water and vegetable stock powder in a medium saucepan and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and the butter and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water has absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-657aa977a65f6d71569fc17e-e4e74e38.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the roasted veggies and baby spinach to the couscous. Toss to coat. Season to taste.\n• Divide roast veggie couscous and haloumi between bowls. Top with yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-657aa977a65f6d71569fc17e-b914f088.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
